{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is nearby, grab it and handle it. If not, approach it. Then, move and check object properties. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToWaypoint    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <SubTree ID = HandleObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
    "BT": {
        "Blackboard": [
            {
